ward extrusion, highlighting their differences for a comprehensive analysis. I'm focusing on providing clear definitions and accompanying sketches to illustrate the direction of metal flow. For forward extrusion, I'm noting the simplicity of the tooling but high friction and force requirements. Conversely, I'm emphasizing the benefits of backward extrusion, such as reduced friction and force, but also noting the complexity.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content","thinking"]}
